19
00:00:53.725 --> 00:00:56.835
Su agente de inteligencia artificial
responde consultas,

20
00:00:57.084 --> 00:00:58.385
registra interesados,

21
00:00:58.670 --> 00:00:59.858
programa seguimientos

22
00:00:59.936 --> 00:01:02.105
